Third-party services (runtime)
------------------------------
Voice transcription and text cleanup in the shipped beta use Freestyle Cloud
(freestyle.sh). Audio and transcript text are sent to that service when you are
signed in. Search uses Brave Search when you configure an API key; otherwise
mock providers demonstrate the UI locally.

See README.md § "Third-party services and privacy" for user-facing disclosure.

Included components
-------------------
This repository vendors or depends on numerous open-source packages. Their
licenses appear in node_modules and in upstream Freestyle release artifacts.
Notable UI components are vendored from the beUI registry (MIT) as documented
in upstream .lore.md.

